\title{Transfer along the slab}
\date{2026-11-27}

\p{The [slab operator](fdip-01AE) takes projected values
from opposite sides of each layer. Which pair of values determines
the next pair? If the same step is repeated, what can its sign
tell us about the Wilson operator on one transverse slice?}
